    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=607676369777722266&sectionId=607676370030494618)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggY41n2o-TO_text","label":"ggY41n2o-TO_text","default":"<p><strong>THE REAL PROBLEM</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwkynPz5gr_text","label":"ggwkynPz5gr_text","default":"<strong>It’s Not Just Age. Your Libido, Drive, Energy &amp; Bedroom Confidence </strong><span style=\"color:#54B94A;\"><strong>Are Fading After 30.</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR3mdbHPDa_text","label":"ggR3mdbHPDa_text","default":"<p>You know this feeling all too well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You used to have energy that lasted well past 2pm. Drive that showed up naturally. Strength that didn’t fade halfway through a workout. Confidence that made you feel unstoppable — especially in the bedroom.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now? You’re dragging through the day on caffeine. Your workouts feel flat and heavy. Motivation is slipping. The drive and libido you once took for granted have quietly disappeared.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And in the bedroom? Let’s be honest — you’re not performing like you used to. You feel it. She feels it.&nbsp;</p><p>And it’s quietly affecting your confidence.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You keep telling yourself it’s just stress. Just age. Just a phase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It’s not.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It’s your body’s three core performance systems breaking down at the same time.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmSFapMRGm_text","label":"ggmSFapMRGm_text","default":"<p>❌ <strong>SYSTEM 1: CORTISOL &nbsp;OVERDRIVE</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-9T7eLkbh_text","label":"gg-9T7eLkbh_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Stress hormones stay elevated, crushing your energy, restricting blood flow, and suppressing testosterone production at the source.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Result: constant fatigue, brain fog, and fading drive.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggB5fHYY213_text","label":"ggB5fHYY213_text","default":"<p>❌ SYSTEM 2: BLOOD FLOW &nbsp;RESTRICTION</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTHPrqJzfz_text","label":"ggTHPrqJzfz_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Nitric oxide levels drop. Circulation weakens to your muscles, brain, and everywhere that matters - including the bedroom.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Performance becomes inconsistent and unreliable.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYvahvjpEs_text","label":"ggYvahvjpEs_text","default":"<p>❌ SYSTEM 3: TESTOSTERONE &nbsp;DECLINE</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9yDfKWRMv_text","label":"gg9yDfKWRMv_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After 30, testosterone drops 1-2% every year. By 40, most men have lost 10-20% of their peak levels. Strength, libido, confidence, and recovery all follow it down.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3Vug87ntI_text","label":"gg3Vug87ntI_text","default":"<p>Most men try to fix just one system - a T-booster here, more caffeine there, or sheer willpower.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>But when all three systems are failing together, fixing one barely makes a difference.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>You need to restore all three at once.</strong></p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
